@guide H_BladesEdge
@name Blade's Edge Mountains (Thunderlord Stronghold)
@faction Horde
@levels 66-68
@zone Blade's Edge Mountains
@chapter Outland
@desc Thunderlord Stronghold, the Bloodmaul and Bladespire ogres, Evergrove, Mok'Nathal Village and Rexxar's chain.
@next Both_Netherstorm

fp Thunderlord Stronghold
bind Thunderlord Stronghold
accept The Encroaching Wilderness | Gor'drek.
accept The Bladespire Threat | Tor'chunk Twoclaws.
accept They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews! | T'chali the Witch Doctor.
accept Felling an Ancient Tree [optional]
accept Killing the Crawlers | Grunt Grahk.
complete The Encroaching Wilderness
complete The Bladespire Threat
complete They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews!
complete Killing the Crawlers
turnin The Encroaching Wilderness
accept Dust from the Drakes
turnin The Bladespire Threat
accept The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin They Stole Me Hookah and Me Brews!
accept Bladespire Kegger
turnin Killing the Crawlers
complete Dust from the Drakes
complete The Bloodmaul Ogres
complete Bladespire Kegger
turnin Dust from the Drakes
accept Protecting Our Own
turnin The Bloodmaul Ogres
turnin Bladespire Kegger
complete Protecting Our Own
turnin Protecting Our Own
accept A Time for Negotiation... | Tree Warden Chawn, Evergrove.
fp Evergrove
turnin A Time for Negotiation...
accept ...and a Time for Action
accept Poaching from Poachers
accept Culling the Wild
accept Little Embers
accept From the Ashes
complete ...and a Time for Action
complete Poaching from Poachers
complete Culling the Wild
complete Little Embers
complete From the Ashes
turnin ...and a Time for Action
turnin Poaching from Poachers
turnin Culling the Wild
turnin Little Embers
turnin From the Ashes
accept Mok'Nathal Treats [optional] | Matron Varah, Mok'Nathal Village.
fp Mok'Nathal Village
complete Mok'Nathal Treats [optional]
turnin Mok'Nathal Treats [optional]
level 68
note Fly to Area 52 in Netherstorm.
